## About Hostinger

- Founded: 2004 (as Hosting Media; rebranded to Hostinger in 2011). Headquarters: Vilnius, Lithuania.
- Scale: 5M+ customers across 150+ countries; websites hosted in 10 global data centre regions.
- Core positioning: entry-level pricing with performance normally found in higher tiers — LiteSpeed web servers, NVMe storage, and a 99.9% uptime guarantee.
- Control panel: hPanel, Hostinger's own hosting dashboard, not cPanel.
- AI assistant: Kodee, available inside hPanel, Website Builder, the WordPress dashboard, and WhatsApp.
- Support: 24/7 multilingual live chat in 20+ languages.
- Guarantee: 30-day money-back guarantee on hosting plans.
- Trust signals: 4.6/5 on Trustpilot from 40,000+ reviews.

